  "details": "I personally would like to display that I speak Kurdish in my profile, but my language is just not an option, which is simply a bit frustrating. I'm sure there are lots of other people who sadly can't display what languages they speak because the list simply doesn't contain theirs.\n\nI feel like theres probably got to be some open/free language list to pull from for this.\n\nAs some other post has mentioned, another little improvement that can help that profile section is a hover-over effect displaying the full name of the language. Perhaps that could be both in native writing and in English, so something like (Kurdî/Kurdish), when hovering over said language's 3-character abbreviator).",
